'''Bronze Hallow''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player that finished '''3rd''' on the leaderboard during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]].

== Appearance ==
Its blade is white in the shape of a cutlass with spiky bronze pumpkin vines going along the spine. The guard is made out of a bronze pumpkin with four bronze horns and a demonic face imprinted on it in black. Black pumpkin vines with bronze tints protrude out from behind the pumpkin. The handle is bronze in color with the bottom of it being curled.

== Trivia ==
*During the event, players could collect as many [[Candies (2018)|Candies]] (acts exactly like [[coins]] but Halloween-exclusive) and score points which would determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Red Hallow]], [[Silver Hallow]], and [[Gold Hallow|Gold Hallow.]]
*This item is a bronze reskin of [[Hallow's Blade]]/[[Hallow's Edge]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this knife is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/16003401/profile Never_Again101]'''.
**However, Never_Again101's account was terminated during November 2024 for an unknown reason, most likely due to being compromised.
*The owner of this weapon became inactive after claiming this items.

